WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:04.690
When I was asked
to curate a show,

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:08.320
I jumped at the opportunity.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.100
I'm putting together 15
different performances

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:15.140
that show ballet isn't just
pink tights and a tutu.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.840
I've never done anything
like this before,

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:20.220
so it's way out of
my comfort zone.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.760
I have five days
to do everything,

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:24.500
and then I have to dance
well on top of that.

00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:30.300
Hip hop, tap, ballet--

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:34.410
it's about fusing
together different styles.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:39.330
It feels very important to be
a woman in charge of this show,

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:41.530
in a dance world run by men.

00:00:41.530 --> 00:00:43.380
This is a first.

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:46.170
I'm just hoping that it all
doesn't come crashing down.

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:48.320
1-2-3-4--

